(  182) !$acc & PMFD, PMFUS, PMFDS, PMFUQ, PMFDQ, PMFUL, PLUDE, PLUDELI, PLRAIN, PSNDE, PDMFUP, PDMFDP, PDPMEL, PLGLAC, PMFLXR, PMFL
